# Generated views, marked so GitHub collapses them in PR review (#76): the
# sources are the reviewable surface, and the regenerated views were reading
# as "this PR changes 20 files". They stay committed — ADR-032's reasons
# stand (badges land on real pages, staleness fails the lint) — this only
# changes how review renders them.
#
# The list mirrors the outputs luria.toml declares. That is a projection, and
# the cost of it drifting is one uncollapsed diff in review — display only,
# so a mismatch is an annoyance, never an error.
docs/decisions/** linguist-generated=true
docs/design-principles.md linguist-generated=true
docs/configuration.md linguist-generated=true
docs/devlog/** linguist-generated=true
docs/reports/** linguist-generated=true
